  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe are ready to provide you with advice or a quote.\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003ESend us an enquiry \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:umb://document/695010147d8a408a8922b1d1b4f1d905}#reachout\u0022 title=\u0022Head Office\u0022 data-anchor=\u0022#reachout\u0022\u003Ehere\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E or call \u003Cstrong\u003E060 727 8002.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003EOur accredited facilities are equipped to perform a wide range of chemical tests related to aggregates. These tests ensure the quality of designs for roadworks and concrete.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
